WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:08.000
Step 1. Click Choose File and select a Gamry .DTA export. Try tutorial_cv.DTA to follow along.

00:00:08.000 --> 00:00:18.000
Step 2. Choose whether to include metadata, then click Convert to .xlsx.

00:00:18.000 --> 00:00:30.000
Step 3. Open the downloaded workbook. CURVE contains the measurements, and Header contains the optional metadata.
